    "long_instructions": "## The High-Score Hub: Designing for Alex\r\n\r\n**The User:** Alex wants an online marketplace app for trading vintage video games. She wants the site to feel retro, like it's from the 1980s.\r\n\r\n**Step 1.** Prompt AI to generate your web app layout (HTML). Briefly describe what AI changed, e.g. \"Created index.html for garden web app\". Then click **Accept and save version**.\r\n\r\n::: details [**What should I write in my prompt?**]\r\nThink about it:\r\n> What information (e.g., game title, condition, trade value) does the marketplace track for each video game listing?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n**Step 2.** Prompt AI to generate your page style (CSS).\r\n\r\n::: details [**What should I write in my prompt?**]\r\nThink about it:\r\n> What specific fonts, colors, and layout style should the page use to look like a retro arcade game?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n**Step 3.** Add in images to your site.\r\n\r\n**Step 4.** Use the activity guide checklist to brainstorm more features to add to your site.",
